+| 2 | Q2_0, Q2_0_G128 | `defined(DATA_A_Q2_0) \|\| defined(DATA_A_Q2_0_G128)` | `a.qs.x ^= 0x88888888;` |
+| 3 | Q4_0, Q4_1, Q5_0, Q5_1, Q8_0, MXFP4 | `defined(DATA_A_QUANT_LEGACY) \|\| defined(DATA_A_MXFP4)` | `a.qs.x ^= 0x88888888;` |
+| 4 | Q2_K | `defined(DATA_A_Q2_K)` | `a.qs.x ^= 0x88888888;` |
